                    </div>
                </div>


                <div class="min-w-[280px] sm:min-w-[340px] bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 aspect-video mb-4">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608231387042-66d1773070a5?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600" alt="Zapatilla Puma Ultra Light" class="w-full h-full object-cover transform hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                        <span class="absolute top-2 left-2 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">Popular</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Puma Ultra Light</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">Amortiguación superior y ligereza.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-auto">
                        <span class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">$145.00</span>
                        <button onclick="agregarDirecto('Puma Ultra Light', 145.00, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608231387042-66d1773070a5?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl transition">Añadir</button>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <div class="min-w-[280px] sm:min-w-[340px] bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 aspect-video mb-4">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551107696-a4b0c5a0d9a2?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600" alt="Zapatilla Air Max Pro" class="w-full h-full object-cover transform hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Air Max Pro</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">Diseño urbano para uso diario.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mt-auto">
                        <span class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">$110.00</span>
                        <button onclick="agregarDirecto('Air Max Pro', 110.00, 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551107696-a4b0c5a0d9a2?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl transition">Añadir</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section id="catalogo" class="space-y-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Catálogo de Productos</h2>
                <div class="flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-2 sm:pb-0">
                    <button onclick="filtrarProductos('todos', this)" class="filtro-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-sm transition">Todos</button>
                    <button onclick="filtrarProductos('Running', this)" class="filtro-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition">Running</button>
                    <button onclick="filtrarProductos('Urbano', this)" class="filtro-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition">Urbano</button>
                    <button onclick="filtrarProductos('Entrenamiento', this)" class="filtro-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition">Entrenamiento</button>
                    <button onclick="filtrarProductos('Basketball', this)" class="filtro-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition">Basketball</button>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div id="grid-productos" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-6">

            </div>
        </section>


        <section id="nosotros" class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Tecnología de Alto Rendimiento</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Nuestras zapatillas incorporan materiales de alta resistencia, suelas ergonómicas y tejidos transpirables para ofrecer el máximo confort y durabilidad en cada movimiento.
            </p>
        </section>

    </main>


    <footer class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 py-6 transition-colors">
